From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_hnat: harden FOE allocation, roaming,
 mcast, debugfs, and IPv6 hooks

Prevalidate PPE count and FOE allocation transactions, sequence roaming socket bind and teardown, fix multicast kick and IPv4/IPv6 neighbour invalidation, and unwind debugfs/hook probe errors.
Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
